1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:02,208 --> 00:01:05,878
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I entered middle school
when I was around twelve.</font>

3
00:01:05,961 --> 00:01:12,676
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But then in my third year Kitahoro High,
near my house, was holding entrance exams...</font>

4
00:01:16,222 --> 00:01:18,057
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">At fifteen, in spring...</font>

5
00:01:19,975 --> 00:01:21,018
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I met you.</font>

6
00:01:22,561 --> 00:01:25,940
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought, "If I could become like
Kazehaya... maybe... that could help me grow</font>

7
00:01:26,023 --> 00:01:29,401
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">and change?"</font>

8
00:01:34,657 --> 00:01:35,574
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks a lot!</font>

9
00:01:46,877 --> 00:01:50,798
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was always Kazehaya
who inspired change in me.</font>

10
00:01:55,886 --> 00:01:59,807
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This year was so different from all of the
years before... But that part of the story</font>

11
00:01:59,890 --> 00:02:03,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">would take too long.</font>

12
00:02:14,613 --> 00:02:19,577
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">NEW YEAR</font>

13
00:02:20,578 --> 00:02:23,497
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm sorry. You must find this so boring.</font>

14
00:02:24,331 --> 00:02:27,126
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I do want people to see me in a
better light next year. So I'll try to-</font>

15
00:02:27,209 --> 00:02:30,004
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They already do. I'm certain.</font>

16
00:02:31,881 --> 00:02:34,675
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's easier to talk to you now. A lot.</font>

17
00:02:35,551 --> 00:02:36,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You'll be just fine.</font>

18
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:40,222
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You'll be just fine.</font>

19
00:02:40,306 --> 00:02:43,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If... If you say something like that... all
the makeup that Ayane just put on me is</font>

20
00:02:43,434 --> 00:02:46,645
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">gonna...</font>

21
00:02:46,729 --> 00:02:49,648
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I'm sorry!
- Please, just give me three seconds!</font>

22
00:02:49,732 --> 00:02:52,651
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Three?</font>

23
00:03:00,075 --> 00:03:04,330
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest, I had a good
impression of you to begin with.</font>

24
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:08,375
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You were smiling. Right
before our first day.</font>

25
00:03:11,212 --> 00:03:14,381
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was when you showed
me the way to class.</font>

26
00:03:16,342 --> 00:03:18,427
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We were put in the same class.</font>

27
00:03:19,428 --> 00:03:22,514
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I never saw you smile like that again.</font>

28
00:03:24,308 --> 00:03:27,686
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So I was curious what
kind of a person you were.</font>

29
00:03:30,231 --> 00:03:36,528
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When we met each other for the first
time... I didn't think he remembered that.</font>

30
00:03:36,612 --> 00:03:39,865
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I figured you were a nice person, at the
very least... but you turned out to be way</font>

31
00:03:39,949 --> 00:03:43,202
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">more...</font>

32
00:03:44,453 --> 00:03:45,704
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Way more"?</font>

33
00:03:46,914 --> 00:03:51,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, so does that mean he
really thinks I'm a nice person?</font>

34
00:03:53,587 --> 00:03:57,841
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even today, I was surprised
because you were so different.</font>

35
00:03:57,925 --> 00:04:02,471
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?! I apologize! Scaring you
like that was never my intention!</font>

36
00:04:02,554 --> 00:04:05,266
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh, that's not what I meant by that...</font>

37
00:04:07,768 --> 00:04:09,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's not.</font>

38
00:04:12,106 --> 00:04:13,607
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? Then what?</font>

39
00:04:13,691 --> 00:04:17,736
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Forget it! Let's line up at the shrine.</font>

40
00:04:21,991 --> 00:04:24,159
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's almost time!</font>

41
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:29,039
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They already do. I'm certain.</font>

42
00:04:30,708 --> 00:04:34,920
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you say that I'm
changing, then it might be true...</font>

43
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:42,052
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Remember when you first met Kurumi, you
mentioned how you wanted to become cuter?</font>

44
00:04:42,761 --> 00:04:47,391
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You have a reason for wanting that
don't you? Think about what it is.</font>

45
00:04:47,474 --> 00:04:52,104
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ayane, after thinking about
it, there's only one answer.</font>

46
00:04:55,983 --> 00:04:58,861
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My feelings are all over the place.</font>

47
00:04:58,944 --> 00:05:02,656
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I never could have
imagined... you'd be this cute.</font>

48
00:05:04,491 --> 00:05:08,704
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Before, I just wanted to
become more like Kazehaya...</font>

49
00:05:09,913 --> 00:05:15,669
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But now, all I care about is how to
make him think I'm as cute as possible.</font>

50
00:05:22,593 --> 00:05:23,510
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Touching...</font>

51
00:05:25,429 --> 00:05:29,099
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- What is this? And when is it gonna end?
- Dunno. When Joe's</font>

52
00:05:29,183 --> 00:05:32,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}tired of Yano-chin I guess?</font>

53
00:05:33,687 --> 00:05:37,566
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Seriously, I'm outta here.</font>

54
00:05:37,649 --> 00:05:39,318
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye, Joe. I'll see ya.</font>

55
00:05:39,401 --> 00:05:40,736
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Later, man!</font>

56
00:05:40,819 --> 00:05:41,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Amazake...</font>

57
00:05:42,196 --> 00:05:43,614
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hold on, Ryu!</font>

58
00:05:43,697 --> 00:05:45,783
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh. Joe, your jacket...</font>

59
00:05:47,701 --> 00:05:51,372
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nice huh?! I just picked it
up the other day, y'know! Hah!</font>

60
00:05:51,455 --> 00:05:55,125
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think all those holes you got in it
are from getting hit by bonfire sparks.</font>

61
00:05:55,209 --> 00:05:58,837
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What?</font>

62
00:06:01,715 --> 00:06:03,634
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Bye now...
- But what about</font>

63
00:06:03,717 --> 00:06:05,636
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">praying pray at the shrine!</font>

64
00:06:05,719 --> 00:06:08,972
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And after we came all the way out here...
- Chizu, just go.</font>

65
00:06:09,765 --> 00:06:10,641
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

66
00:06:10,724 --> 00:06:13,894
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You probably didn't explain anything to
him and just dragged him along, right? Go</font>

67
00:06:13,977 --> 00:06:17,689
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">on! Get outta here!</font>

68
00:06:17,773 --> 00:06:21,485
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm sorry, Yano-chin! The
ramen's on me next time!</font>

69
00:06:21,568 --> 00:06:25,280
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nah, that's okay. I'll get fat.</font>

70
00:06:25,364 --> 00:06:28,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was expensive too...
But, now we're alone.</font>

71
00:06:31,161 --> 00:06:35,082
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ryu! Hey, hold up! How
come you ran off like that?</font>

72
00:06:35,165 --> 00:06:39,086
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sorry. It was too dumb I
couldn't stand it anymore.</font>

73
00:06:39,169 --> 00:06:45,384
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That was blunt. Would it kill
you to try being a little nicer?</font>

74
00:06:46,385 --> 00:06:51,223
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah! Try to say
"Chii" for me, 'kay? Chii!</font>

75
00:06:52,391 --> 00:06:56,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Absolutely not.</font>

76
00:06:56,520 --> 00:07:00,107
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">How come? It'll make you smile.</font>

77
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,483
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, either way...</font>

78
00:07:01,567 --> 00:07:06,029
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No matter how Kuronuma acts or who they
end up running into, Shota's got it under</font>

79
00:07:06,113 --> 00:07:10,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- control.
- W-Well, yeah! I guess that's true.</font>

80
00:07:10,659 --> 00:07:13,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Jus' leave 'em alone.
You're being too nosy.</font>

81
00:07:13,537 --> 00:07:16,373
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We just wanted to sneak a peek at 'em.</font>

82
00:07:17,791 --> 00:07:21,170
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Besides, I don't think that there's
anything to worry about. At least it seems</font>

83
00:07:21,253 --> 00:07:24,673
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">like it's going well.</font>

84
00:07:28,051 --> 00:07:28,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See?</font>

85
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:35,476
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So yeah, I'm gonna have
some amazake and leave.</font>

86
00:07:35,559 --> 00:07:37,895
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No. You're not. You are gonna
come pray at the shrine with me.</font>

87
00:07:37,978 --> 00:07:40,314
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wha-- Amazake...</font>

88
00:07:45,152 --> 00:07:48,238
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Five! Four! Three!
Two! One! Happy New Year!</font>

89
00:07:55,412 --> 00:07:57,873
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And a Happy New Year to you!
- And a Happy New Year to</font>

90
00:07:57,956 --> 00:08:00,709
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you! I'm lookin' forward to it.</font>

91
00:08:00,792 --> 00:08:05,255
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y-Yeah, same here! I'm looking
forward to the next one too!</font>

92
00:08:06,590 --> 00:08:09,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Another year!</font>

93
00:08:10,761 --> 00:08:13,055
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Text?</font>

94
00:08:13,138 --> 00:08:16,642
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

95
00:08:17,684 --> 00:08:21,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh yeah, I do have one! There's two!</font>

96
00:08:21,980 --> 00:08:25,359
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They're from Chizu and Ayane!</font>

97
00:08:26,735 --> 00:08:28,278
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are you gonna reply?</font>

98
00:08:28,362 --> 00:08:29,404
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait, can I?!</font>

99
00:08:29,488 --> 00:08:30,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Of course!</font>

100
00:08:33,325 --> 00:08:35,160
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ha... ppy... New... Year... There...</font>

101
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:44,670
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even with texting her you
beat me to the punch. Oh, well.</font>

102
00:08:46,004 --> 00:08:49,508
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because of you, I'm
having fun. So, thanks.</font>

103
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:52,344
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, Sawako sent me a text back!</font>

104
00:08:53,053 --> 00:08:56,473
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And it looks like she
returned my "Happy New Year."</font>

105
00:08:56,557 --> 00:08:59,977
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"I'm looking forward to
spending another year with you."</font>

106
00:09:04,815 --> 00:09:09,444
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Last year, I experienced so
many things for the first time.</font>

107
00:09:11,238 --> 00:09:13,407
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You ready? It's our turn.</font>

108
00:09:13,490 --> 00:09:15,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">HOW TO PRAY:
TWO BOWS</font>

109
00:09:17,202 --> 00:09:23,292
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And the reason I was able to experience...
and even enjoy all of these new things...</font>

110
00:09:33,719 --> 00:09:35,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Was because I met everyone.</font>

111
00:09:41,018 --> 00:09:45,147
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was a truly
unforgettable year for me. Thank you.</font>

112
00:09:50,902 --> 00:09:56,116
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Woo, be careful. It's slippery.
- Y... you're right.</font>

113
00:10:04,041 --> 00:10:04,958
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here.</font>

114
00:10:25,228 --> 00:10:28,440
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My brother said he'll
be back New Year's Day...</font>

115
00:10:31,693 --> 00:10:32,611
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">With her.</font>

116
00:10:34,988 --> 00:10:38,617
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You, uh... haven't
memorized her name yet, have you?</font>

117
00:10:39,701 --> 00:10:40,786
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She got me.</font>

118
00:10:40,869 --> 00:10:46,333
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's Haruka! Get it together, man!
She's gonna be your sister-in-law, right?</font>

119
00:10:47,084 --> 00:10:49,461
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But, I'll be there.</font>

120
00:10:55,133 --> 00:10:56,385
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ryu.</font>

121
00:10:56,468 --> 00:11:00,055
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If anything ever happens to you, ya know?
I'm gonna be there to help you pick up all</font>

122
00:11:00,138 --> 00:11:03,767
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">the pieces, okay?</font>

123
00:11:08,063 --> 00:11:10,524
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If it ever does, I'll count on you.</font>

124
00:11:20,617 --> 00:11:23,912
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Let's draw fortunes.
- Sure.</font>

125
00:11:27,499 --> 00:11:32,629
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FORTUNES
100 YEN</font>

126
00:11:32,713 --> 00:11:36,258
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I got Great Luck!
- Amazing!</font>

127
00:11:37,092 --> 00:11:39,386
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Everything will go your way."</font>

128
00:11:39,469 --> 00:11:44,641
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Suppress your impatience and behave
yourself, always maintain a calm state of</font>

129
00:11:44,725 --> 00:11:49,938
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">mind." "Be sure to seek out advice
from others..." Can I do all this?</font>

130
00:11:56,194 --> 00:11:58,655
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I- I wonder what I ended up with.</font>

131
00:11:59,197 --> 00:12:02,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Hmmm, maybe Small
Luck? I doubt I got Great...</font>

132
00:12:08,290 --> 00:12:12,627
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I should've lowered my expectations.</font>

133
00:12:12,711 --> 00:12:15,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I feel like I've started
getting a little too greedy lately...</font>

134
00:12:15,505 --> 00:12:18,550
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Alright then? What'd you get?</font>

135
00:12:18,633 --> 00:12:23,054
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Umm,... well...</font>

136
00:12:23,764 --> 00:12:29,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">LOVE: THE CURRENT PERSON IS BEST,
DO NOT QUESTION IT.</font>

137
00:12:29,936 --> 00:12:30,979
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, Bad Luck.</font>

138
00:12:32,814 --> 00:12:33,732
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The best...</font>

139
00:12:35,692 --> 00:12:38,278
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- That couldn't be more true.
- It's actually lucky! I</font>

140
00:12:38,361 --> 00:12:40,947
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">mean it. 'Cuz it's rare!</font>

141
00:12:41,823 --> 00:12:42,866
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Really?</font>

142
00:12:44,451 --> 00:12:48,497
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You usually tie these onto
the tree branches, right?</font>

143
00:12:49,164 --> 00:12:51,458
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma.</font>

144
00:12:52,709 --> 00:12:55,378
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here. I want you to have this.</font>

145
00:12:56,505 --> 00:12:59,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Your Great Luck fortune?</font>

146
00:13:00,050 --> 00:13:02,010
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But that's how do I put it...</font>

147
00:13:03,553 --> 00:13:06,181
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I feel like I might steal all the
luck from you if I accept your fortune...</font>

148
00:13:06,264 --> 00:13:08,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's fine, take it.</font>

149
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:12,562
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I already have good luck. Besides...</font>

150
00:13:15,565 --> 00:13:16,817
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean...</font>

151
00:13:19,569 --> 00:13:21,655
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want to give it to you...</font>

152
00:13:25,325 --> 00:13:28,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Though for a birthday
gift it might be kinda lame.</font>

153
00:13:34,167 --> 00:13:35,710
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th-Thank you.</font>

154
00:13:39,965 --> 00:13:42,759
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Have I ever really questioned it?</font>

155
00:13:45,470 --> 00:13:49,891
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thinking back on it, how could I not tell
these feelings were something romantic the</font>

156
00:13:49,975 --> 00:13:54,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">whole time? It doesn't make sense.</font>

157
00:13:57,274 --> 00:14:02,404
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't know... how I ever saw him
as only someone to be admired.</font>

158
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:16,459
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Awesome! I spent the New
Year's countdown alone with Ayane!</font>

159
00:14:17,836 --> 00:14:21,590
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I finally found you! This kid! I swear!
You promised me that you'd stay close to</font>

160
00:14:21,673 --> 00:14:23,842
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">the bonfire 'mister!</font>

161
00:14:23,925 --> 00:14:26,094
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Gosh, sorry for all the trouble.
Thanks for looking after our stupid son.</font>

162
00:14:26,177 --> 00:14:28,346
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mom, wait, I'm in the middle of
something very important right now!</font>

163
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:30,765
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, no prob.</font>

164
00:14:30,849 --> 00:14:34,644
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Come on, we're going home! -Ayane! -Look
at all these holes! No New Year's money</font>

165
00:14:34,728 --> 00:14:38,523
